WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Open Channels
From Settings & channels open the Channels tab, then choose WhatsApp.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Start the Meta connection
Press the connect button and sign in with the Meta account that has permission to manage your business.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Choose the business and number
Follow Meta's window to choose the business portfolio, the WhatsApp account and the phone number, and complete the required verification.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Check the connection
Go back to Channels and check the connection status. Send a message from another number and confirm it appears in Conversations.
